<title>USA: Nevada says hires advisors.</title>
<headline>Nevada says hires advisors.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA BARBARA, Calif. 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nevada Energy Co said it has retained the New York investment banking firm of Gerard Klauer Mattison to assist it in matters related to corporate finance, mergers and acquisitions.</p>
</text>
